{"product": {"id": 6914179891396, "title": "Derma Roller For Growth", "body_html": "<div style=\"line-height: 1.3; padding-bottom: 15px;\">\n<p>Transform thinning hair with our precision-engineered derma roller\u2014featuring <strong>250 gold-coated titanium needles that increase scalp blood flow by 400%</strong>.</p>\n<p>The clinically optimal 1mm depth activates dormant follicles without bleeding or downtime, <strong>delivering results in just 5 minutes twice week.</strong>\u00a0</p>\n<p>Experience an invigorated scalp by week 2, baby hairs by week 6, and visible density by week 12.</p>\n<p>Unlike cheap rollers that tear skin, each FullyVital roller is hand-inspected for perfectly aligned needles that glide smoothly and stay sharp 3x longer.</p>\n<p>Your investment includes a protective case, technique guide, and 120-day results guarantee\u2014because we're confident you'll see transformation.</p>\n<p>Apply our Hair Density Serum immediately after rolling for maximum follicle regeneration.</p>\n</div>", "vendor": "FullyVital", "product_type": "Hair Loss Treatments", "created_at": "2021-10-06T19:14:13-07:00", "handle": "derma-roller", "updated_at": "2026-10-18T17:23:45-07:00", "published_at": "2021-10-20T16:10:44-07:00", "template_suffix": "derma-roller", "published_scope": "web", "tags": "Faire, Hair, Roller, roller-video", "variants": [{"id": 40744263844036, "product_id": 6914179891396, "title": "Default Title", "price": "39.99", "sku": "HAIRGROWROL1", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "49.00", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2021-10-06T19:14:13-07:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-18T17:23:45-07:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": null, "grams": 125, "image_id": null, "weight": 4.4, "weight_unit": "oz", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_b